    "projectDescription": "New specialist cancer treatment centre with proton beam therapy suite and research laboratories",
    "projectNarrative": "Manchester University NHS Foundation Trust is delivering a world-class specialist cancer treatment centre to consolidate and expand oncology services across Greater Manchester. The facility includes a proton beam therapy suite requiring exceptional precision in construction, alongside research laboratories and outpatient consultation spaces. The project has embraced an MMC-first approach from inception, with BAM's off-site manufacturing division providing structural and architectural components. The FBC demonstrates strong value for money through reduced programme and improved build quality.",
